!
! The mean latency (lodestone_rules.h LR2), in Trebago: the sum of the
! latencies measured over their count, an exact reduced rational of
! milliseconds, never rounded (1, 2 and 2 ms are 5/3). Every latency is
! 0..3600000 (Retort's range, RT2): ok is 1 when there is at least one and
! none is outside, and 0 otherwise, and the answer is divided by it, so a
! latency outside the range is a division by zero, refused.
trebago latency_mean_ms
  in  ms(n)
  out avg
  var ok
  ok = min(1, max(0, n)) * (1 - min(1, sum(j, min(1, max(0, 0 - ms(j))) &
     + min(1, max(0, ms(j) - 3600000)))))
  avg = sum(j, ms(j)) / n / ok
end
